{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, move towards and take it. Otherwise, scan area and move to new location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaScanned    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
